# The ferocious condition is checked only as the attack is declared (ruling): it is not an intervening "if". On turn 5
# Bot1 attacks with the Pursuer while controlling Surrak (power 4); with the trigger on the stack Bot2 destroys Surrak with
# Infernal Grasp (losing 2 life; Surrak's own trigger draws Bot1 a card). The Pursuer trigger still resolves and the
# Pursuer is a 3/3 that deals 3: Bot2 20 - 2 - 3 = 15.

